<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ayomal Beach Paradise | Professional Beachfront Hotel Galle</title>
    
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;700&family=Poppins:wght@200;300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/aos/2.3.4/aos.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --gold: #d4af37;
            --dark: #0a0a0a;
            --light-dark: #161616;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --accent: #ff9800;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { 
            background-color: var(--dark); 
            color: var(--white); 
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; 
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- NAVIGATION --- */
        nav {
            position: fixed; width: 100%; padding: 10px 6%;
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
        }
        .nav-logo { height: 60px; width: auto; transition: 0.3s; }

        /* --- HERO SECTION (CENTERED FIX) --- */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh; /* Full screen height */
            display: flex; 
            align-items: center; /* Vertical Center */
            justify-content: center; /* Horizontal Center */
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.5), rgba(0,0,0,0.8)), 
                        url('https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/805677678.jpg?k=35e8ed42ee03826206db9c419f11ad1eed3a7d456a6d651c10970f252fd909ba&o=') no-repeat center center/cover;
            background-attachment: scroll;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero-content h1 { 
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 10vw, 5rem); 
            color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .hero-content p { font-weight: 300; font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0.9; }

        /* --- BOOKING SECTION --- */
        .booking-wrap {
            max-width: 1100px; margin: -60px auto 0; position: relative; z-index: 99;
            background: #1a1a1a; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
        }
        .booking-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px; align-items: end;
        }
        .b-field label { display: block; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .b-field input, .b-field select { 
            width: 100%; padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #333; 
            background: #222; color: white;
        }
        .b-btn-main { 
            background: var(--gold); color: #000; border: none; padding: 15px; 
            border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .b-btn-main:hover { background: #b8972f; }

        /* --- CONTENT SECTIONS --- */
        section { padding: 80px 8%; }
        .section-title { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; color: var(--gold); font-size: 2.5rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        
        .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
        .feat-card { background: var(--light-dark); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #222; }
        .feat-card i { font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 20px; }

        .gallery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; }
        .gallery-grid img { width: 100%; height: 250px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; filter: brightness(0.8); }

        .review-box { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 4px solid var(--gold); margin-bottom: 20px; }

        /* --- MODAL --- */
        .modal { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.95); z-index: 2000; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .modal-content { background: #1a1a1a; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid var(--gold); max-width: 500px; width: 90%; text-align: center; }

        footer { padding: 40px; background: #050505; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #111; }
        .map-frame { width: 100%; height: 350px; border-radius: 12px; border: none; margin-top: 20px; }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .booking-wrap { margin-top: 20px; width: 95%; }
            .hero { height: 100vh; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
    <a href="#"><img src="ayomal-logo.png" alt="Logo" class="nav-logo"></a>
    <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--gold);">GALLE • SRI LANKA</div>
</nav>

<div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content" data-aos="zoom-out">
        <p>Private Beachfront Estate</p>
        <h1>Ayomal Beach Paradise</h1>
        <div style="width: 50px; height: 2px; background: var(--gold); margin: 30px auto;"></div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="booking-wrap" data-aos="fade-up">
    <div class="booking-grid">
        <div class="b-field"><label>Check-in</label><input type="date" id="checkin"></div>
        <div class="b-field"><label>Check-out</label><input type="date" id="checkout"></div>
        <div class="b-field">
            <label>Guests</label>
            <select id="guests"><option>2 Adults</option><option>1 Adult</option><option>Family</option></select>
        </div>
        <button class="b-btn-main" onclick="openBooking()">Check Availability</button>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 15px;">
        <button onclick="sendWhatsApp()" style="flex:1; background:#25D366; color:white; border:none; padding:12px; border-radius:4px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;">WhatsApp Inquiry</button>
        <button onclick="openModal()" style="flex:1; background:#333; color:var(--gold); border:1px solid var(--gold); padding:12px; border-radius:4px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;">Pay Advance</button>
    </div>
</div>

<section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Why Guests Love Us</h2>
    <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feat-card" data-aos="fade-up"><i class="fa fa-umbrella-beach"></i><h3>Direct Beach Access</h3><p>Step out from your room directly onto the golden sands.</p></div>
        <div class="feat-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100"><i class="fa fa-bed"></i><h3>Clean Rooms</h3><p>Highly rated for cleanliness and modern comfort.</p></div>
        <div class="feat-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200"><i class="fa fa-wifi"></i><h3>Free Wi-Fi</h3><p>High-speed internet throughout the property.</p></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section style="background: #0d0d0d;">
    <h2 class="section-title">Photo Gallery</h2>
    <div class="gallery-grid">
        <img src="https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/806556707.jpg?k=6d431a6b77c9899e2ae91fde3706793ab0f75b282ed7c5432a03286b1b60d355&o=" data-aos="zoom-in">
        <img src="https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/806559427.jpg?k=aa80b34656be8635f7de525e79cf10201d9c675920e236cee820a22e602414d9&o=" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="100">
        <img src="https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/805677678.jpg?k=35e8ed42ee03826206db9c419f11ad1eed3a7d456a6d651c10970f252fd909ba&o=" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Guest Reviews</h2>
    <div class="review-box" data-aos="fade-right"><span>★★★★★</span><p>“Amazing beachfront location with clean rooms and friendly staff.”</p><small>– Google Maps Guest</small></div>
    <div class="review-box" data-aos="fade-left"><span>★★★★★</span><p>“Excellent value for money. Quiet and peaceful.”</p><small>– Booking.com Guest</small></div>
</section>

<section style="background: #0d0d0d;">
    <h2 class="section-title">Contact</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center;">📞 +94718208812 

ayomalbeachparadise@email.com</p>
    
<section style="background: #0d0d0d;">
    <h2 class="section-title">Location</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">📍 No. 85 Galle Road, Pitiwella, Boossa, Sri Lanka</p>
    <iframe class="map-frame" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3967.337483648166!2d80.149257375929!3d6.085023927429141!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3ae1715093739777%3A0xe545089222442981!2sAyomal%20Beach%20Paradise!5e0!3m2!1sen!2slk!4v1700000000000!5m2!1sen!2slk" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy"></iframe>
</section>

